      "writtenOn": "2024-10-23T22:43:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e all owners must be committers.\n\nAs mentioned previously in a couple places, this is supposed to be true but is not true in practice, and we don\u0027t currently have a plan in place for how to fix this.\n\nSo, there is a real problem here.",
      "parentUuid": "adb77a4a_e50f4947",
      "revId": "20fbd154032146429b7c19b10ab904eaf3cead2a",
