        "id": 1115906
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-10-23T22:58:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the guidance still stands then. If it turns out that the owner is not a committer then we can remove them from OWNERS when this comes up, as opposed to working around this not-WAI behavior.",
      "parentUuid": "3e168287_e274b194",
      "revId": "20fbd154032146429b7c19b10ab904eaf3cead2a",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
